sequenceDiagram
    actor Verifier as Public/Verifier
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant BC as Ethereum (Sepolia)

    Verifier->>FE: Input Diploma Hash
    FE->>BE: GET /api/diploma/verify/{hash}
    BE->>DB: Query tbl_diploma_record by hash
    
    alt Found in DB
        DB-->>BE: Diploma Data (tx_hash, student_name, etc.)
        BE-->>FE: 200 OK (data)
        FE->>BC: ethers.verifyDiploma(hash)
        BC-->>FE: On-chain Status (isValid, isRevoked, timestamp)
        FE->>FE: Compare DB Data vs On-chain Data
        FE-->>Verifier: Display Success & Verified Badge
    else Not Found
        DB-->>BE: None
        BE-->>FE: 404 Not Found
        FE-->>Verifier: Display "Invalid Diploma"
    end
